{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "从上到下逐行生成杨辉三角，每行两端固定为 1。内部位置由上一行相邻的两个数相加得到，例如第 5 行的 6 来自 3 + 3。动画使用示例 numRows = 5，依次展示每一行及其计算来源。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>杨辉三角生成过程</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d}\n.badge{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-size:10px}\n.formula{font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.triangle{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:4px 0}\n.row{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:4px;opacity:.18;transition:opacity .45s}\n.row.visible{opacity:1}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.cell .num{font-size:14px;line-height:1.2}\n.cell .index{margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.cell.parent{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.result{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.result .num{color:#fff;font-weight:600}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;display:inline-block;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.dot.parent{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.dot.result{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.rule{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.rule code{color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>numRows = <span class=\"num\">5</span></h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">逐行扩展，内部数 = 左上方 + 右上方。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<span class=\"badge\" id=\"stepLabel\">第 1 行</span>\n<span class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\">首行边界值 <strong>1</strong></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"triangle\" id=\"triangle\">\n<div class=\"row\" data-row=\"0\"><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"0-0\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">r1·p1</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-row=\"1\"><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"1-0\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p1</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"1-1\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p2</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-row=\"2\"><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"2-0\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p1</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"2-1\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"index\">p2</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"2-2\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p3</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-row=\"3\"><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"3-0\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p1</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"3-1\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"index\">p2</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"3-2\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"index\">p3</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"3-3\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p4</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-row=\"4\"><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"4-0\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p1</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"4-1\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"index\">p2</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"4-2\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"index\">p3</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"4-3\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"index\">p4</span></div><div class=\"cell\" data-key=\"4-4\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"index\">p5</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><span class=\"dot parent\"></span>上一行加数</span><span><span class=\"dot result\"></span>新数</span></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"rule\"><strong>规则：</strong>首尾 <code>1</code>；内部 = <code>左上方 + 右上方</code>。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const rowsCount=5,triangle=[],steps=[];\n  for(let row=0;row<rowsCount;row++){\n    triangle[row]=[];\n    for(let col=0;col<=row;col++){\n      const edge=col===0||col===row;\n      triangle[row][col]=edge?1:triangle[row-1][col-1]+triangle[row-1][col];\n      steps.push({row,col,target:row+'-'+col,parents:edge?[]:[(row-1)+'-'+(col-1),(row-1)+'-'+col],text:edge?'第 '+(row+1)+' 行的边界固定为 1':triangle[row-1][col-1]+' + '+triangle[row-1][col]+' = '+triangle[row][col]});\n    }\n  }\n  steps.push({row:4,col:4,target:null,parents:[],text:'前 5 行全部完成, 最后一行为 [1,4,6,4,1].'});\n\n\n  const rows = [...document.querySelectorAll('.row')];\n  const cells = [...document.querySelectorAll('.cell')];\n  const label = document.getElementById('stepLabel');\n  const formula = document.getElementById('formula');\n  let current = 0;\n\n  function showStep(step) {\n    cells.forEach(cell => {\n      cell.classList.remove('parent', 'result');\n      const [r,c]=cell.dataset.key.split('-').map(Number);\n      cell.querySelector('.num').textContent=r<step.row||(r===step.row&&c<=step.col)?triangle[r][c]:'?';\n    });\n    rows.forEach((row, index) => row.classList.toggle('visible', index <= step.row));\n    step.parents.forEach(key => {\n      const cell = document.querySelector(`[data-key=\"${key}\"]`);\n      if (cell) cell.classList.add('parent');\n    });\n    if (step.target) {\n      const target = document.querySelector(`[data-key=\"${step.target}\"]`);\n      if (target) target.classList.add('result');\n    }\n    label.textContent = step.target === null ? '生成完成' : `第 ${step.row + 1} 行`;\n    formula.innerHTML = step.text.replace(/(\\d+ \\+ \\d+ = \\d+|\\b\\d+\\b)/g, '<strong>$1</strong>');\n  }\n\n  function advance() {\n    showStep(steps[current]);\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n  }\n\n  advance();\n  setInterval(advance, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O(r²)","space_complexity":"O(r²)","complexity_note":"r 为 numRows. 前 r 行共有 r(r + 1) / 2 个元素, 时间和空间均包含完整返回三角形; 在返回结构中直接逐行构造, 额外工作变量为 O(1)."}
